== the keystore under a policy
idle                                     unlocked cached=memory autoLock={"idleMinutes":1,"onScreenLock":true,"from":{"idleMinutes":"config","onScreenLock":"config"}}
free                                     unlocked cached=keystore
keystore entries                         [aged#secret-key free free#secret-key idle#secret-key]
== idle, a minute of 2 s
unlock                                   ok
used every 0.5 s for 3 s                 true
locked within 8 s of background listings true
idle                                     locked lockedBy=idle autoLock={"idleMinutes":1,"onScreenLock":true,"from":{"idleMinutes":"config","onScreenLock":"config"}}
a use                                    locked: the vault is locked: run tsync vault unlock
== the screen
unlock                                   ok
unlock free                              ok
screen report, idle                      ok
screen report, free                      ok
idle                                     locked lockedBy=screen autoLock={"idleMinutes":1,"onScreenLock":true,"from":{"idleMinutes":"config","onScreenLock":"config"}}
free                                     unlocked cached=keystore
unlock                                   ok
idle, after the unlock                   unlocked cached=memory autoLock={"idleMinutes":1,"onScreenLock":true,"from":{"idleMinutes":"config","onScreenLock":"config"}}
lock                                     ok
== age, a minute of 0.05 s: an hour of 3 s
unlock                                   ok
locked while used, after 3 s or more     true
aged                                     locked lockedBy=age autoLock={"maxHours":1,"from":{"maxHours":"config"}}
lock free                                ok
unlock                                   ok
unlock free                              ok
keystore entries                         [aged#secret-key free free#secret-key idle#secret-key]
owner exit status 0
== after a restart
idle                                     locked autoLock={"idleMinutes":1,"onScreenLock":true,"from":{"idleMinutes":"config","onScreenLock":"config"}}
free                                     unlocked cached=keystore
unlock, the passphrase alone             ok
owner exit status 0
